  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "A common safety/performance strategy is to block avatars overinclusively and then selectively show people's avatars one at a time.\nUnfortunately, there is currently no way to view the details of a blocked avatar. This makes it impossible to judge whether to keep an avatar blocked or whether its performance cost is reasonable.\nPlease enable users to view the avatar details of an avatar they currently have blocked. This includes fully blocked avatars and avatars replaced by fallback.",
